  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Specifically, water from the Dreaming. Normally, I'd say we just go to the Eucalyptus Forest and ask the Drovers there.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Veg_WL-WOBB_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But by the time we navigate all those politics, Ned's armor will just rust away. So we'll try to find a trace of the Green Lake.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Veg_WL-WOBB_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That's what that greenish crater used to be. There might be the tiniest of remnants left underground, in the Bunyip Warrens.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Veg_WL-WOBB_019.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Don't worry, it's night; the Bunyips have come out to feed on the souls of joeys that don't eat their veggies...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Veg_WL-WOBB_020.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...Or so I've been told. The Warrens should be empty at any rate.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Kangaroo_Cabal_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Judge_Veg_WL-WOBB_021.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594064,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-WOBB-NPC03_Persona",
